# Test: show crashes works offline (no daemon) via the offline fallback
# VALIDATES: `show crashes` routes to the in-process crashlog fallback when no
#            daemon is reachable -- essential because you inspect crashes after
#            the daemon has died.
# REGRESSION: the fallback was unreachable because RunCommand rejected commands
#            absent from the CLI tree before reaching cli.Run; RunCommand now
#            routes commands with a registered offline fallback to the daemon
#            path (daemon when up, in-process fallback when down).
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze show crashes
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=crashes
